Hello <%= @invitation.recipient.fetch("name") %>,

<%= @invitation.invited_by.full_name %> invited you to review a document for <%= @company.name %>.

This private link opens version <%= @invitation.revision.number %>. You can comment, request changes or approve this version for signing. Review approval is not a signature.

<%= @review_url %>

The link expires <%= @invitation.expires_at.utc.strftime("%d %B %Y at %H:%M UTC") %>. Anyone with this link can access this version until it expires or is revoked. Please do not forward it.

If the document changes, ask the sender for a new review link.
